Bundled programs (sidecars)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Release builds ship these unmodified programs next to the Offbeat binary.
They are downloaded by scripts/fetch-binaries.sh and are not part of this
repository.

  yt-dlp    https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp
            The Unlicense (public domain).

  ffmpeg    https://github.com/yt-dlp/FFmpeg-Builds
  ffprobe   Static "gpl" build of FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org), licensed under
            the GNU General Public License v3 or later. The license text is
            saved as src-tauri/binaries/FFMPEG-LICENSE.txt. The source code
            and build scripts are at https://github.com/yt-dlp/FFmpeg-Builds
            and https://git.ffmpeg.org/ffmpeg.git.

  deno      https://github.com/denoland/deno
            MIT License.

